---
permalink: /concepts/bento/services.html
station: services
seoTitle: "Professional Voice Over Services & Rates | Overnight Radio Inc."
seoDescription: "Over 50 thousand radio spots produced since 1998. Creating national quality productions for broadcasts, at a surprisingly affordable rate!"
---
<section class="wrap pagehead reveal">
  <p class="eyebrow">Our Services</p>
  <h1 class="display display--page"><i>Professional</i> Voice Over Services</h1>
</section>
<section class="wrap bento bento--2">
  <article class="tile tile--span2 reveal">
    <p class="lead">Creativity, and quality are the basis of any successful Radio Ad campaign. We believe that you can and should have national quality commercial productions at any level of broadcasting...and that’s what we offer.</p>
    <p>With over 50 thousand radio spots produced since 1998, our team has the skills and experience to create national quality commercial productions for broadcast...at a surprisingly affordable rate.</p>
    <p>If you need top-notch radio spots turned around quickly, and affordably, we are Overnight Radio Inc, and we’re your team.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="tile tile--dark tile--center reveal">
    <span class="badge-mark" aria-hidden="true">{% include "mark.njk" %}</span>
    <p class="tile__title">Need a spot?</p>
    <p class="muted-light">Writing &amp; production ...returned the <b>NEXT DAY!</b></p>
  </article>
  <article class="tile tile--accent tile--span3 reveal">
    <p class="tile__title">Writing, acting, announcing, radio commercial production... as much or as little as you need.</p>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="wrap section-head reveal">
  <h2 class="h2">Monthly Radio Commercial Package <i>Pricing</i></h2>
  <p class="muted">{{ pricing.intro }}</p>
  <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Package" data-seg>
    <button type="button" class="is-on" aria-pressed="true" data-tier="gold">Gold · 50 units</button>
    <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-tier="silver">Silver · 25 units</button>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="wrap bento bento--3" data-tiers data-show="gold">
  {% for m in pricing.markets %}
  <article class="tile price reveal{% if loop.index == 2 %} tile--dark{% endif %}">
    <p class="eyebrow{% if loop.index == 2 %} eyebrow--light{% endif %}">{{ m.population }}</p>
    <h3 class="tile__title">{{ m.name }}</h3>
    {% for tier in ["gold", "silver"] %}{% set t = m[tier] %}
    <div class="price__tier" data-tier="{{ tier }}">
      <p class="price__name">{{ m.name }} {{ tier | capitalize }}</p>
      <p class="price__num">{{ t.monthly }}<small>/month</small></p>
      <ul class="price__facts"><li>{{ t.units }} units/month</li><li>{{ t.perUnit }}/unit</li></ul>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section class="wrap bento bento--2">
  <article class="tile tile--span2 reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Per Spot Radio Commercial Pricing</p>
    <p class="lead">If a commercial monthly package is more than you need, you can purchase them 'per spot' individually.</p>
    <p class="big-line">Per spot pricing starts at <b>$175</b> per local broadcast spot* and <b>$75</b> per script*!</p>
  </article>
  <article class="tile tile--accent reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Internet ads</p>
    <p class="stat stat--sm">$300</p>
    <p class="tile__foot">Internet ads start at $300 - North America only</p>
  </article>
  <p class="fine tile--span3">*Prices refer to a one market broadcast only - *$35 per revision</p>
</section>
